  <Properties>
    <articleTitle>
      <Value Culture="en"><![CDATA[A Silent Threat to Pedestrians: This Is What Accidents Involving Electric Cars Stand Out]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="pl-PL"><![CDATA[Ciche zagrożenie dla pieszych. Tak wyróżniają się wypadki z udziałem samochodów elektrycznych]]></Value>
    </articleTitle>
    <author>
      <Value><![CDATA[umb://document/833364f91e1e4f9a866584920b87dfba]]></Value>
    </author>
    <components>
      <Value Culture="en"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "bc8cfc9b-08fe-4be1-8a61-49c6dedf32ba",
      "key": "dfed792e-6d81-4187-8c08-68fd04dae193",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "componentText",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EElectric vehicles do not cause more accidents than combustion engine cars. However, the nature of these collisions and the circumstances in which they occur differ. This is especially true for pedestrians \u2013 as the study shows, electric vehicles are particularly dangerous for them at low speeds.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOn European roads, we can no longer hear only the clatter of combustion engines, but increasingly also the humming sound. At the beginning of the year, approximately 2 million electric vehicles were registered in Germany, representing about 4% of the entire passenger car fleet. The widespread adoption of electric vehicles is changing many things: new charging stations, new technology \u2013 the aforementioned background noise. Does this also affect road accident statistics?\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "settingsData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "c350d716-b434-45f7-a645-6176f4fb7c2d",
      "key": "b6f7875b-d5c2-472c-9a29-bc03b72789fb",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "hideBlockElement",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "0"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "expose": [
    {
      "contentKey": "dfed792e-6d81-4187-8c08-68fd04dae193",
      "culture": null,
